#<font color=""></font>
Nicola and I return to the elevator, heading for the first floor. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]

[playse storage=BGS/elevator_up.ogg loop=true clear=false layer=5]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_happy.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
Am I glad to finally talk to a girl, really! [l]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_frown.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
I haven’t been back to Earth in months, and it can get quite repetitive talking to the same dudes over and over... [p]
[image storage=default/EuphieSprites/euphie_normal_speak.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#ff8080">Euphie</font>
How long have you been staying there? [p]
[freeimage layer=2]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_question.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
I’d say... [l]Around six months? [l]We stay here for quite a while, then take a couple of weeks off down on Earth, then come back again. [p]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#ff8080">Euphie</font>
[image storage=default/EuphieSprites/euphie_thinking_normal.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
Isn’t it bad for your mental health to stay secluded in such a place for so long? [p]
[freeimage layer=2]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_neutral.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
You get used to it.  [p]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
A spaceship comes once a week to provide us with our essentials like food, clothes, water, supplies... [l]And we can make an urgent call if needed. [p]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#ff8080">Euphie</font>
[image storage=default/EuphieSprites/euphie_normal_stressed.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
That’s probably the thing that scares me the most, to be honest... [l]In space, you still have to depend on the people down on Earth to help you... [p]
[freeimage layer=2]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_happy.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
Well obviously, we’re all human![l] We all need someone to rely on, and it’s fine! [p]
[freeimage layer=1]

[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

#<font color=""></font>
I didn’t expect such a lighthearted answer...  [p]

