#<font color=""></font>
We enter our quarters’ nearby bathroom. [l]I notice something close to a washing machine for clothes, but with a much more intimidating look. [p]
There’s also a toilet seat, which weirdly looks like some... [l]Bathroom sink. [l]Of course, I know how it works. [l]But am I going to start missing toilet seats, now...? [p]

[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]

[chara_show  name="Nicola"  time="555"  wait="true"  storage="chara/5/nicola_smile.png"  width="495"  height="720"  left="390"  top="0"  reflect="false"  ]
[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_question.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
You probably guessed already, but if we used water just like we do down on Earth during our showers, we’d run out of water in a day. [p]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_neutral.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
Which is why we sit in those tubs, and take a full bath instead. [p]
[image storage=default/EuphieSprites/euphie_normal_speak.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#ff8080">Euphie</font>
Wait, how does the water get drained? [p]
[freeimage layer=2]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_leaning.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
Magic. [p]
[image storage=default/EuphieSprites/euphie_normal_shocked.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#ff8080">Euphie</font>
What. [p]
[freeimage layer=2]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_smile.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
Kidding. [l]I actually don’t really know the details, but Joshua probably does. [p]
I think the water goes through some pipes and is drained into a sort of microgravity change tunnel into space. [p]
[image storage=default/EuphieSprites/euphie_thinking_panicking.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#ff8080">Euphie</font>
That’s probably... [p]
[freeimage layer=2]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
Pricey as hell, indeed, kitten. Which is why we only get to take them once a month. [p]
[freeimage layer=1]

[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

#<font color=""></font>
Wait, what did she just call me? [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
[image storage=default/EuphieSprites/euphie_thinking_normal.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#ff8080">Euphie</font>
Then how do you regularly shower? [p]
[freeimage layer=2]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_neutral.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
See those things that look like orange juice packs?[l] They’re actually filled with warm water mixed with a bit of liquid soap. [p]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_staredown.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
You take one and use it with a clean washcloth. [l]It’s pretty similar to a sponge bath, to put it simply. [p]

[image storage=default/EuphieSprites/euphie_normal_neutral.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#ff8080">Euphie</font>
I see... [p]
[freeimage layer=2]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#85e085">Nicola</font>
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_smile.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
Just throw everything in the bin afterwards, the cleaning bots will take care of it. [p]
[freeimage layer=1]

