#<font color=""></font>
Nicola helped me to sort and pack away my stuff.[l] After that, we decided to go to sleep. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]

[image  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="CG/cg02_euphie-nico-pajamas.png"  ]
